# DraftLens — example environment file
#
# No environment variables have been approved.
#
# DraftLens has not selected a frontend, backend, database, hosting provider,
# data source, or ML serving approach. Until those decisions are made, there is
# nothing to configure here.
#
# Variables will be added only when required by an approved architecture
# decision (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md) or an approved data-source decision
# (docs/DATA.md), and the corresponding decision must be recorded in
# docs/DECISIONS.md.
#
# This file is tracked in version control and must never contain real
# credentials. Copy it to `.env` for local values; `.env` is git-ignored.
